SOAPBOX: tower and 8 80 ft radials. Much better than my 100'shunt-fed
SOAPBOX: tower. Many DX called., and some EU were worked on the first
SOAPBOX: try. Never happened with shunt fed tower. It seems that a
SOAPBOX: requirement of 32 1/4 wave radials is a myth. Limited
SOAPBOX: participation compared to last years. Locally heavy powerline
SOAPBOX: noise. Still managed a few EU and KH6.
